msgid "Yes, absolutely! Intern registration, profile creation, Intern Passport generation, opportunity search, and applications are 100% free for all students, graduates, and internship seekers across Cameroon. No subscription fees, listing fees, or application charges are ever billed to candidates."
msgstr "Yes, absolutely! Intern registration, profile creation, Intern Passport generation, opportunity search, and applications are 100% free for all students, graduates, and internship seekers across Cameroon. No subscription fees, listing fees, or application charges are ever billed to candidates."

#. Answer in the homepage frequently asked questions
#: app/[locale]/page.tsx:216
msgid "Yes, absolutely! Jobs and internships enjoy complete parity on MANTECH Nexus. Recruiters can publish full-time positions, entry-level contracts, apprenticeships, and specialized internships with dedicated salary ranges and work mode options (onsite, hybrid, remote)."
msgstr "Yes, absolutely! Jobs and internships enjoy complete parity on MANTECH Nexus. Recruiters can publish full-time positions, entry-level contracts, apprenticeships, and specialized internships with dedicated salary ranges and work mode options (onsite, hybrid, remote)."

#. Answer in the homepage frequently asked questions
#: app/[locale]/page.tsx:234
msgid "Yes! Academic departments and university placement coordinators have a dedicated portal to supervise tripartite internship conventions, assign faculty mentors, review student progress logbooks, and authenticate institutional completion attestations."
msgstr "Yes! Academic departments and university placement coordinators have a dedicated portal to supervise tripartite internship conventions, assign faculty mentors, review student progress logbooks, and authenticate institutional completion attestations."

#. Answer in the homepage frequently asked questions
#: app/[locale]/page.tsx:288
msgid "Yes! Any visitor, student, or recruiter can share their placement story directly through the community testimonial submission form on the homepage and `/testimonials` page. Approved reviews appear publicly to inspire future cohorts."
msgstr "Yes! Any visitor, student, or recruiter can share their placement story directly through the community testimonial submission form on the homepage and `/testimonials` page. Approved reviews appear publicly to inspire future cohorts."

#. Answer in the homepage frequently asked questions
#: app/[locale]/page.tsx:207
msgid "Yes! During this open launch phase, all organizational plans (including Enterprise and Institutional access) are 0 FCFA. Companies and universities enjoy unlimited job and internship postings, unrestricted talent searches, and full team access without any payment barriers."
msgstr "Yes! During this open launch phase, all organizational plans (including Enterprise and Institutional access) are 0 FCFA. Companies and universities enjoy unlimited job and internship postings, unrestricted talent searches, and full team access without any payment barriers."

#. Answer in the homepage frequently asked questions
#: app/[locale]/page.tsx:252
msgid "Yes. From state universities (UY1, UY2, Douala, Buea, Bamenda, Dschang, Ngaoundéré, Maroua, Bertoua, Ebolowa) to prestigious Grandes Écoles (ENSPY, NAHPI, IUTs, ENS) and accredited private universities (UCAC, IUC, Siantou, Saint Jérôme, PKFokam), our network covers the entire nation."
msgstr "Yes. From state universities (UY1, UY2, Douala, Buea, Bamenda, Dschang, Ngaoundéré, Maroua, Bertoua, Ebolowa) to prestigious Grandes Écoles (ENSPY, NAHPI, IUTs, ENS) and accredited private universities (UCAC, IUC, Siantou, Saint Jérôme, PKFokam), our network covers the entire nation."

